{
  "msg_type": "interactive",
  "card": {
    "config": {
      "wide_screen_mode": true,
      "enable_forward": true
    },
    "header": {
      "title": {"tag": "plain_text", "content": "🚨 A股决策执行提醒"},
      "template": "red"
    },
    "elements": [
      {
        "tag": "div",
        "text": {
          "content": "**【执行结论】**\n{conclusion}",
          "tag": "lark_md"
        }
      },
      {"tag": "hr"},
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "### 🎯 执行区间\n**股票：** {name} ({code})\n**最新价：** {price} | **涨跌幅：** {change_pct}%\n\n📈 **触发信号：** {trigger_signal}\n\n**卖出区间：** {sell_range}\n**失效/止损价：** {stop_loss}\n**仓位动作：** {position_action}"
        }
      },
      {
        "tag": "hr"
      },
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "### 📖 为什么\n{reason}"
        }
      },
      {
        "tag": "div",
        "text": {
          "content": "⚠️ **老张盯你一句：**\n*{discipline_note}*",
          "tag": "lark_md"
        }
      },
      {"tag": "hr"},
      {
        "tag": "div",
        "text": {
          "content": "📌 *仅供参考，不构成投资建议；破位必须走。*",
          "tag": "lark_md"
        }
      },
      {
        "tag": "action",
        "actions": [
          {
            "tag": "button",
            "text": {"content": "执行卖出", "tag": "plain_text"},
            "type": "primary",
            "value": {"command": "execute_sell"}
          },
          {
            "tag": "button",
            "text": {"content": "执行买入", "tag": "plain_text"},
            "type": "danger",
            "value": {"command": "execute_buy"}
          },
          {
            "tag": "button",
            "text": {"content": "继续持有", "tag": "plain_text"},
            "type": "default",
            "value": {"command": "hold"}
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}